      "description": "当前工作流唯一突出的主操作。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\">保存设置</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-primary { height: 36px; padding: 8px 14px; border: 1px solid #8A285D; border-radius: 10px; background: #8A285D; color: #FFFFFF; font: 600 14px/1.4 Inter, system-ui, sans-serif; cursor: pointer; transition: background-color 160ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), border-color 160ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); } .ds-btn-primary:hover { background: #6C204B; border-color: #6C204B; } .ds-btn-primary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #9F356C; outline-offset: 2px; } .ds-btn-primary:active { background: #3F1830; border-color: #3F1830; } .ds-btn-primary:disabled { cursor: not-allowed; opacity: 0.58; } @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { .ds-btn-primary { border-color: #D57BA6; background: #D57BA6; color: #27101E; } .ds-btn-primary:hover { border-color: #E8AAC7; background: #E8AAC7; } .ds-btn-primary:focus-visible { outline-color: #F0A4C9; } .ds-btn-primary:active { border-color: #BF4F87; background: #BF4F87; } }"
    },
    {
